    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Search latency",
      "description": "p50 is what a typical search sees; p95 and p99 are the tail. A search waits on OpenSearch, the embedding provider and Qdrant together, so a dependency that is slow one time in twenty shows up here far more often than one request in twenty.",
